  "limitations": [
    "This scoped review does not certify production readiness, performance, application health, worker readiness, listener drain or atomic traffic cutover.",
    "Independent native generation inspection used explicit TCP. Local AF_UNIX remains kernel-denied; separate hosted Unix and full aggregate results are root-owned gates.",
